    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.3 (Build 6)</title>
      <link>https://github.com/xmannv/xzip/releases/tag/v1.0.3-6</link>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&amp;#x27;s New&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fix(macos): stop crash when a process exits without reading stdin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The stdin writer used a FileHandle that the terminal path could close first;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FileHandle.write then raised an uncatchable Objective-C exception. The writer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;now owns a dup&amp;#x27;d descriptor and writes with Darwin.write.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also bump build to 1.0.3 (build 6).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/xmannv/xzip/releases/tag/v1.0.3-6"&gt;View details on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
